    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so my neighbor has this massive hydroponic setup in their backyard and they have these automated misting cycles like every hour. whenever they spray it, there's this weirdly sweet, heavy smell that drifts right into my bedroom window. i've been feeling really lightheaded and off lately since it started up. do u know any ways i can neutralize or filter out those airborne particulates so they don't get into my house?",
